Dialogue: 5,0:19:41.64,0:19:45.62,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}止まりはしない
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.59,0:19:52.98,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}ハイウェイ飛んでいった
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.98,0:19:56.65,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}まだ割れたままの
Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.55,0:19:59.74,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}バイウェイ見慣れた
Dialogue: 5,0:19:59.74,0:20:04.16,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}この画面の中から
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.52,0:20:06.75,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}ワンウェイ指差した
Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.75,0:20:15.54,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}心が動く、走る　走る　走る
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.30,0:20:25.56,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}「何年経っても離さないでいて」
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.72,0:20:40.51,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}荒い風を切っても君の声が聞こえる　聞こえる　聞こえる近さで
Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.51,0:20:54.52,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}弱くてもそばにいれば、僕らはずっと　ずっと
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.52,0:20:56.92,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}ハイウェイ飛んでいった
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.92,0:21:00.52,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}昨日の涙は
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.31,0:21:07.80,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}サンデイ晴れた太陽に手を伸ばしたら
Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.80,0:21:14.63,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}今日は届くだろうか、と思う
Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.63,0:21:21.72,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}きっと僕は
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.72,0:21:35.18,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}辛い道を選んでも君がいれば歌える　歌える　歌える気がする
Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.00,0:21:50.58,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}ここにいて僕は１人じゃないとやっとふと気づくのさ
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.19,0:22:05.15,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}淡い期待
Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.15,0:22:10.25,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}雲をスッと突き刺してく
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.25,0:22:11.99,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}苦い未来
Dialogue: 5,0:22:11.99,0:22:17.40,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}後ろ髪でも掴んでみたい
Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.40,0:22:19.10,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}ゴールはない
Dialogue: 5,0:22:19.10,0:22:22.34,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}解けかけたまんまで
Dialogue: 5,0:22:24.29,0:22:31.18,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}道は開いていく
Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.18,0:22:37.20,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}旅に出るたび
Dialogue: 5,0:22:37.20,0:22:42.32,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}負けたくないと思う
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.04,0:22:51.00,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}旅に出るたび
Dialogue: 5,0:22:51.00,0:22:56.91,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}強くなりたいと思う
Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.31,0:23:14.35,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}荒い風を切っても君の声が聞こえる　聞こえる　聞こえる近さで
Dialogue: 5,0:23:14.35,0:23:30.67,JP - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}目を開けて？そばにいるさ、僕らはずっと　ずっとだよ
Comment: 7,0:19:29.86,0:19:29.90,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,------ OP CN ------
Dialogue: 7,0:19:29.88,0:19:41.64,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}每一次踏上旅途 我们的世界都变得五彩斑斓
Dialogue: 7,0:19:41.64,0:19:45.62,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}永不停歇
Dialogue: 7,0:19:50.59,0:19:52.98,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}沿着高速公路飞驰向前
Dialogue: 7,0:19:52.98,0:19:56.65,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}仍旧破碎不全的
Dialogue: 7,0:19:57.55,0:19:59.74,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}司空见惯的乡间小路
Dialogue: 7,0:19:59.74,0:20:04.16,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}从这画面之中延伸
Dialogue: 7,0:20:04.52,0:20:06.75,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}指向那单行道的方向
