Dialogue: 7,0:21:07.80,0:21:14.63,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}今天或许就能触碰得到吧
Dialogue: 7,0:21:14.63,0:21:21.72,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}我想 我一定
Dialogue: 7,0:21:21.72,0:21:35.18,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}哪怕踏上荆棘之路 只要有妳在 我就能高歌
Dialogue: 7,0:21:36.00,0:21:50.58,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}伫立于此 我才恍然惊觉自己并非孤身一人
Dialogue: 7,0:22:03.19,0:22:05.15,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}淡淡的期待
Dialogue: 7,0:22:05.15,0:22:10.25,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}倏地刺穿云层
Dialogue: 7,0:22:10.25,0:22:11.99,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}苦涩的未来
Dialogue: 7,0:22:11.99,0:22:17.40,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}也想试着紧抓不放
Dialogue: 7,0:22:17.40,0:22:19.10,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}没有终点
Dialogue: 7,0:22:19.10,0:22:22.34,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}任凭它松散未解
Dialogue: 7,0:22:24.29,0:22:31.18,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}道路在眼前延展
Dialogue: 7,0:22:31.18,0:22:37.20,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}每一次踏上旅途
Dialogue: 7,0:22:37.20,0:22:42.32,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}都想着不愿认输
Dialogue: 7,0:22:45.04,0:22:51.00,CN - Top,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fax-0.1\blur3\3c&H035CD5&}每一次踏上旅途
